      <div class="d-bubble"><div class="who">유나</div><div class="ko">처음엔 힘들었지만 마침내 이뤘어요. 우리 꿈이 현실이 됐네요!</div><div class="gl">It was hard at first, but at long last we did it. Our dream has become real!</div></div>
